OL,3,ANorway in national mourning after death
OL,4,Aof King Harald V
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorway has entered a period of national
OL,7,Fmourning following the death of King
OL,8,FHarald V
OL,10,FThe king, who was on the throne for 35
OL,11,Fyears, died early on Friday at the
OL,12,Fnational hospital in Oslo where he was
OL,13,Fbeing treated for a rare blood
OL,14,Fcondition
OL,16,FHarald was a popular leader and is
OL,17,Fcredited with modernising the Norwegian
OL,18,Fmonarchy - he broke with tradition by
OL,19,Fmarrying a commoner, Queen Sonja
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
