OL,3,ANorway in national mourning after death
OL,4,Aof King Harald V
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlowers are being laid at a memorial
OL,7,Fnear the palace, and the UK's King
OL,8,FCharles III shares his "most heartfelt
OL,9,Fcondolences"
OL,11,FNorway's new King Haakon is meeting
OL,12,Fgovernment ministers at the palace - he
OL,13,Fis joined by his daughter, Crown
OL,14,FPrincess Ingrid Alexandra
